meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Tafsirin Saad 38:54 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim\">\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Lalle wannan, haƙĩƙa, azurtarwar Mu ce, bã ta ƙãrẽwa.\">\n<meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#1f4d3a\">\n<meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/og.png\">\n<meta name=\"twitter:card\" content=\"summary_large_image\">\n<script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\": \"https://schema.org\", \"@type\": \"BreadcrumbList\", \"itemListElement\": [{\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 1, \"name\": \"Shafin farko\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 2, \"name\": \"Sura Saad\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/surah/38.html\"}, {\"@type\": \"ListItem\", \"position\": 3, \"name\": \"Aya 54\", \"item\": \"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/38-54.html\"}]}</script>\n<link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/icon.svg\" type=\"image/svg+xml\">\n<link rel=\"preconnect\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Amiri+Quran&family=Amiri:wght@400;700&family=Noto+Naskh+Arabic:wght@400;600&display=swap\">\n<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/theme.css\">\n<style>body{font-family:system-ui,\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif;color:var(--ink);padding:20px 16px 48px;line-height:1.6}.tr{font-size:17px;line-height:1.8;margin:0}.cr{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)}.ar{direction:rtl;text-align:right}</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<main class=\"sp\"><nav class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> › <a href=\"/ha/surah/38.html\">Sura Saad</a> › Aya 54</nav><h1>Tafsirin Sura Saad 38:54</h1><p class=\"vt ar\" lang=\"ar\">﴿إِنَّ هَٰذَا لَرِزْقُنَا مَا لَهُ مِن نَّفَادٍ﴾</p><section><h3>Fassarar ma&#x27;ana</h3><p class=\"tr\">Lalle wannan, haƙĩƙa, azurtarwar Mu ce, bã ta ƙãrẽwa.</p><span class=\"cr\" dir=\"ltr\">Hausa Translation - Abu Bakr Jumi — v1.2.2 · QuranEnc.com</span></section><p class=\"cr\">An kawo maganganun limaman biyu da Larabci na asali, kalma bayan kalma, tare da madogara.</p><section><h2>Imam Ibn al-Qayyim</h2><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">وإنما استفيد عدم انتهاء نعيم الجنة بقوله: {إن هذا لرزقنا ما له من نفاد}<cite>«شفاء العليل في مسائل القضاء والقدر والحكمة والتعليل» 1/258</cite></blockquote><blockquote class=\"ar\" lang=\"ar\">ولهذا جاء أن أهل الجنة في مزيد دائم بلا انتهاء فإن نعيمهم متصل ممن لا نهاية لفضله ولا لعطائه، ولا لمزيده ولا لأوصافه.<cite>«مدارج السالكين بين منازل إياك نعبد وإياك نستعين» 2/256</cite></blockquote></section><a class=\"btn pri open\" href=\"/tafsir.html?lang=ha#s38a54\">Bude a cikin tafsiri mai mu&#x27;amala (cikakkun rubutu)</a><div class=\"pn\"><a href=\"/ha/ayah/38-45.html\">Ayar da ta gabata (38:45)</a><a href=\"/ha/ayah/38-75.html\">Aya ta gaba (38:75)</a></div></main><footer class=\"site-foot\"><span>Tafsirin Shehunan Biyu · <a href=\"/ha/\">Shafin farko</a> · <a href=\"/about.html\">Game da aikin</a> · <a href=\"/privacy.html\">Sirri da sharudda</a></span><a href=\"https://doersadv.com\" rel=\"noopener\" dir=\"ltr\">Developed by Doers</a></footer>\n</body>\n</html>\n","ayah/38-75.html":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"ha\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n<title>Tafsirin Saad 38:75 — bisa ga Ibn Taimiyya da Ibn al-Qayyim</title>\n<meta name=\"description\" content=\"(Allah) Ya ce, &quot;Yã Ibilis! Mẽ ya hana ka, ka yi sujada ga abin da Nã halitta da HannayeNa biyu? Shin, kã yi girman kai ne, kõ kuwa kã kasance daga maɗaukak\">\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ha/ayah/38-75.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"ar\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/38-75.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/ayah/38-75.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://tafsirshaikhain.com/en/ayah/38-75.html\">\n<link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"